{"path":"utility/optional/operator*","title":"std::optional<T>::operator->, std::optional<T>::operator*","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::optional&lt;T&gt;::</span>operator-&gt;, <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::optional&lt;T&gt;::</span>operator*","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/optional/operator*","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"Accesses the contained value.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> T<span class=\"sy2\">*</span> operator<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> T<span class=\"sy2\">*</span> operator<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy2\">*</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy2\">*</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy2\">*</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy2\">*</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Accesses the contained value.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Returns a pointer to the contained value.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Returns a reference to the contained value.</div>\n<p>The behavior is undefined if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> does not contain a value.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Pointer or reference to the contained value.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>This operator does not check whether the optional contains a value! You can do so manually by using <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/optional/operator_bool\">has_value()</a></span> or simply <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/optional/operator_bool\">operator bool()</a></span>. Alternatively, if checked access is needed, <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/optional/value\">value()</a></span> or <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/optional/value_or\">value_or()</a></span> may be used.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iomanip&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;optional&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">using</span> <span class=\"kw1\">namespace</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">string_literals</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/optional\"><span class=\"kw1082\">std::<span class=\"me2\">optional</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> opt1 <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"opt1: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>opt1 <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>opt1 <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"opt1: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>opt1 <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/optional\"><span class=\"kw1082\">std::<span class=\"me2\">optional</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> opt2 <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"abc\"</span>s<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"opt2: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/quoted\"><span class=\"kw1819\">std::<span class=\"me2\">quoted</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>opt2<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\", size: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> opt2<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>size<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"co1\">// You can \"take\" the contained value by calling operator* on an rvalue to optional</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> taken <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">move</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>opt2<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"taken: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/quoted\"><span class=\"kw1819\">std::<span class=\"me2\">quoted</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>taken<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span>\n                 <span class=\"st0\">\"opt2: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/quoted\"><span class=\"kw1819\">std::<span class=\"me2\">quoted</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>opt2<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\", size: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> opt2<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>size<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>  <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>opt1: 1\nopt1: 2\nopt2: \"abc\", size: 3\ntaken: \"abc\"\nopt2: \"\", size: 0</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue2762\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 2762</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++17\n</td>\n<td><code>operator-&gt;</code> and <code>operator*</code> might be potentially-throwing\n</td>\n<td>made noexcept\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/optional/value\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>value</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the contained value <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/optional/value_or\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>value_or</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the contained value if available, another value otherwise <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/optional","title":"std::optional"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::optional<T>::operator->, std::optional<T>::operator*","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++17. Accesses the contained value."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Pointer or reference to the contained value."},{"label":"Notes","note":"This operator does not check whether the optional contains a value! You can do so manually by using has_value() or simply operator bool()."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"value","note":"returns the contained value"},{"label":"value_or","note":"returns the contained value if available, another value otherwise"}]}]},"standards":["C++17"],"wordCount":296,"codeBlockCount":2}
